flowchart TB
    Brand[PHNX Browser branding] --> Icon[Logo, app icon, favicon]
    Brand --> Copy[Browse Freer.]
    Brand --> About[About and Phoenix attribution]
    Brand --> Metadata[SEO and social metadata]
    Metadata --> Actual[Actual GitHub Pages URL]
    Security[Public website security] --> NoSecrets[No keys, tokens, passwords, or credentials]
    Security --> GitHubSecrets[Use GitHub Secrets for sensitive values]
    Security --> Accurate[Accurate privacy and security claims]
    Security --> Links[Verified repository and release links]

    classDef brand fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b45309,color:#78350f,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef public fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#2563eb,color:#172554,stroke-width:1.5px
    classDef safe fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#16a34a,color:#14532d,stroke-width:1.5px
    class Brand,Icon,Copy,About,Metadata,Actual brand
    class Security,NoSecrets,GitHubSecrets,Accurate,Links public
    class Actual,NoSecrets,GitHubSecrets,Accurate,Links safe
